("Guard JSON parsing", "Wrap fromJson in try/catch, validate the required keys and show an error state on malformed data.", "A broken API response currently crashes the app via the global handler.", "S", "P0", MA + "#_Backbone"),
("Null-safe map access", "Use getOrDefault and type checks for every API key (Telegram, Discord, *_Latest, ...).", "A missing key causes a NullPointerException with .toString().", "S", "P0", MA + "#_Backbone"),
