("Parse numeric strings robustly", "Accept '3.0' (Gson doubles) in numeric sorts and version codes by parsing as Double or Long.", "Integer.valueOf throws NumberFormatException on Gson-produced numbers.", "S", "P1", "SketchwareUtil.java"),
